Bugfix: Fix wrong count in the blob list summary of `prune` errors

When the repository index was incomplete, `restic prune` listed the missing
blobs with a "(N more)" summary whose count was too low by one, and which even
turned negative ("(-1 more)") when exactly ten blobs were missing. The summary
now reports the correct number of unlisted blobs.

https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/4451
